        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"933054\">Snir Broshi</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/287929-mathlib4/topic/antidiagonal.20vs.20antidiag/near/620877493\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"330967\">Wrenna Robson</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/287929-mathlib4/topic/antidiagonal.20vs.20antidiag/near/620655891\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I think my <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/38380\">#38380</a> is going to want to wait for this to be fixed</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I don't think anyone is working on this, so waiting might take a while.</p>\n<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"330967\">Wrenna Robson</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/287929-mathlib4/topic/antidiagonal.20vs.20antidiag/near/620657531\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I really feel like things have been thrown into uncertainty now for me.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>My point was to draw your attention to this thread; I don't understand how that lead to this.</p>\n<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"330967\">Wrenna Robson</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/287929-mathlib4/topic/antidiagonal.20vs.20antidiag/near/620656844\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I've been told given we're changing names it can't now merge.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I never said such a thing, and I even clarified I hold no authority.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>That's fair! I appreciated you telling me. I am happy to do the work to make this work.</p>\n<p>I also like Prod.diagonalSet. It's just that we seem to generally speaking not do that kind of thing (despite the fact that IMO it makes sense).</p>",
